  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-sockets.html#network\r\n\r\nFor some reason, when reading the spec in reader view, the method names are not displayed.\r\nReading\r\n\r\nsocket .\r\nReturns the URL that was used to establish the WebSocket connection.\r\n\r\nsocket .\r\nReturns the state of the object's connection. It can have the values described below.\r\n\r\nsocket .\r\n\r\netc. does not make much sense.\r\n\r\nAt least one programmer has bad eyesight, and prefers the Reader View, when reading online documents. Structure is everything, also for screen readers.",
